# schemas/contract-schemas.sha256 — contract-schema pin (issue #98, REQ-D98; REQ-B4).
#
# Six of the seven files are vendored byte-exact from upstream OpenRig:
# `bundle-behaviour`, `bundle-common`, `bundle-configurations`,
# `bundle-status`, `registry-entry` and `run-record` `.v1.schema.json` come from
# `package/daemon/docs/reference/schemas/` in the `npm pack @openrig/cli@0.7.4`
# tarball (sha256 d11dd8a6fc78f0c4d7afeae462c07c2af0fb9fe460990950be495016734920a1,
# the digest in schemas/rigspec-keys.pinned.json); the five bundle/registry
# schemas ship bytes identical to 0.7.2, `run-record` is new in this pin
# (sha256 b3c7ac64fd9dd51152888c99fdbcadd85cddebebb2d38253864bff054da3fde7,
# re-verified byte-for-byte from the published tarball). When `rig` is on
# PATH, verify-rigs V18 `cmp`s them against the installed package's copies.
# Do not edit them; refresh them only from a newer pinned tarball, together
# with this pin.
#
# `agent-manifest.v1.schema.json` stays heretek-local: upstream ships no
# agent-manifest schema.
#
# Format is `sha256sum` output (re-verify with
# `sha256sum -c schemas/contract-schemas.sha256`).
05f83aeff3d548b26165ba458c2ff21dd64798ea01990b67b86b40b2988c56bd  agent-manifest.v1.schema.json
